**Practical Example: User Registration Tests with CSV**

**File: `src/test/resources/user-data.csv`**
```csv
email,name,age,valid
john@example.com,John Doe,30,true
jane@example.com,Jane Smith,25,true
invalid-email,Invalid User,30,false
