**Dynamic Data Generation:**

```java
class DynamicDataGenerationTest {

    @ParameterizedTest
    @MethodSource("randomNumbersProvider")
    void testWithRandomNumbers(int number) {
        assertTrue(number >= 0 && number <= 100);
    }

    static Stream<Integer> randomNumbersProvider() {
